# The control of contingent.scn: the same person as close, petting the robot about as often, but at random moments -
# whatever the robot does. Its acts should not multiply the way they do when they are answered.
duration 12:00
clock 14:00
seed 51
room_light on
owner home
at 0:05 person owner enter 0 0.3
at 0:50 responder random pet 20
